---
import ScrollReveal from "../ui/ScrollReveal.astro";
---
<section id="contact" class="py-24 px-6">
  <ScrollReveal>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      <p class="text-primary font-medium text-sm tracking-widest uppercase mb-3">Contacto</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-text mb-6">Hablemos <span class="text-primary">🚀</span></h2>
      <p class="text-text-muted text-lg max-w-xl mx-auto mb-10">¿Tienes un proyecto en mente o quieres conversar sobre oportunidades? Estoy abierto a nuevos retos.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-6">
        <a href="mailto:alejandrocabezaoficial@gmail.com" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-6 py-4 bg-primary text-white rounded-xl hover:bg-primary-dark transition-colors">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" /></svg>
          alejandrocabezaoficial@gmail.com
        </a>
        <a href="https://alejandrocabeza.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-6 py-4 border border-border text-text rounded-xl hover:border-primary hover:text-primary transition-colors">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 12a9 9 0 01-9 9m9-9a9 9 0 00-9-9m9 9H3m9 9a9 9 0 01-9-9m9 9c1.657 0 3-4.03 3-9s-1.343-9-3-9m0 18c-1.657 0-3-4.03-3-9s1.343-9 3-9m-9 9a9 9 0 019-9" /></svg>
          alejandrocabeza.dev
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </ScrollReveal>
</section>
